HAIStack research artefacts
===========================

Code under this directory is licensed under the Apache License 2.0, the same
license as the rest of the HAIStack repository. See the LICENSE file at the
repository root.

Datasets, corpora, ConceptMaps, policy scenarios, and workload definitions
in this directory are **synthetic**. They contain no protected health
information (PHI) and no de-identified real-patient records.

Unless a file states otherwise, synthetic research datasets are also
released under Apache License 2.0 so they can be redistributed with the
code. They are provided for evaluation, benchmarking, and documentation of
methodology — not as clinical decision support.

If a future artefact uses a third-party terminology or dataset with a
different license (for example UMLS/SNOMED CT), that artefact MUST record
the license, attribution, and access conditions next to the files and MUST
not mix those terms into this default Apache-2.0 grant.
